    <briefdescription>
<para>false </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="structvy__mem" kindref="compound">vy_mem</ref> is an in-memory container for tuples in a single vinyl range. Internally it uses <ref refid="structbps__tree" kindref="compound">bps_tree</ref> to store tuples, which are ordered by statement key and, for the same key, by lsn, in descending order.</para><para>For example, assume there are two statements with the same key, but different LSN. These are duplicates of the same key, maintained for the purpose of MVCC/consistent read view. In Vinyl terms, they form a duplicate chain.</para><para><ref refid="structvy__mem" kindref="compound">vy_mem</ref> distinguishes between the first duplicate in the chain and other keys in that chain. </para>    </detaileddescription>
